    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Heritage Signature (RFI v1.0).</strong></p><p><em>&ldquo;You remember the shape you held before the pressure.&rdquo;</em></p><p><strong>The Thing You Were.</strong> 1/Soma Break, as an action: for the rest of the scene, when you take <strong>kinetic</strong> or <strong>energy</strong> damage, reduce it by your <strong>Tier</strong> (applied before any resistance or immunity, floor at zero). The cost: you answer one question, truthfully, about what you used to be before metamorphosis. Only the GM hears it.</p>",
